tly improved performance across the boardFixed sewer ladder clipping you through the wallFixed crates being displ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-16T04:37:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592793722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3252750-1831432155573006","game_id":"steam-3252750","kind":"update","title":"Nothing at Stake Demo Patch 5/1/2026","summary":"DESIGNRedesigned pause menuImplemented text speed and text hang time optionsIt is now possible to enter ladder from above by walking off (may be finnicky)Normal ladder move directions are now cam-relative, to match vinesAdded prevention for hanging far off vines on the sides or topMASSIVELY increased lantern light rangeModerately increased fire light rangeSet of player states which allow you to do common interactions like eat, drink, use item, use bottle, push&pull, and read made universal and m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-02T03:45:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155573006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3252750-1830163047261768","game_id":"steam-3252750","kind":"update","title":"Nothing at Stake Demo Patch 4/17/2026","summary":"DESIGNTimeline has been cut from 7 days to 3, meaning each individual day is substantially longer (1hr > 2hrs) but the timeline is overall shorter (7hrs > 6hrs)Night made proportionately shorter and evening longer to compensateMany adjustments made to Glass Factory, Sand Caves, and wall descent for ease of immediate understanding, as well as moment to moment goal forming and puzzle solvingProper exit from sewer post-completion, also corrected primary ladder being inaccessible after entryMany mor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-18T02:42:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047261768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3252750-1829528821311670","game_id":"steam-3252750","kind":"update","title":"Nothing at Stake Demo Patch 04/10/2026","summary":"GUIDANCE & DIRECTION A completely revamped opening, with a playable minimal tutorial which does not repeat each cycle, much better shot direction for the starting meteor, and better direction towards the opening meetingBetter sign-driven guidance to first dungeonA bit better tutorialization for first dungeon major puzzle PLAYER Movement improvements across the board! This includes higher global turn rate, jump drifting, slight slide turning, slide into wallclimb, a vault, and moreMany actions fa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-11T04:06:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821311670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3252750-1824459501602739","game_id":"steam-3252750","kind":"update","title":"Nothing at Stake Demo Patch 02/07/2026","summary":"Greatly improved legibility of the opening meeting conversation.Text lasts longer on screen before dissolving.Fixed default inverted camera controls in free cam and x-only modes.Various dialogue guidance clarity improvements.Fixed inverted crow wings.Meteors now correctly fall every day.Added a compass in the village square.Fixed some pathfinding issues.Fixed text height on signs.Added more lights to the starting village.Fixed jellypads interrupting Player death.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-11T05:47:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"